				<title>Makes me feel like I&#039;m back in Sunday School *shudders*</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1619822/volume-19-113-a-01:of-the-instruments-composers-and-the-conf#post-2686120</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 06 Nov 2016 20:07:14 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Dealan-De</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2766852</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I loved the style of writing of the verses! Reminded me of trying to make anything out of the Old Kings James bible my mom had, and being both awed and kinda confused. +1!<br /> Also: &quot;[EXCISED BY ORDER OF THE PATRIARCHS AND THE SCHEMATISTS' COUNCIL]&quot; is my favorite non-Foundation way of expunging, haha</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
