				<wikidot:authorName>MrWrong</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2039383</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>7. And in the rays of the golden sun the MEKHANE saw a third sphere, of water and soil, which it had overlooked in its insignificance.<br /> 7. And the MEKHANE, seeing its Knowledge would be needed, departed for the final sphere f, and was there Broken for Us.</p> </blockquote> <p>Shouldn't the latter be 8?</p> 
				 	]]>
