				<wikidot:authorName>Von Pincier</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1315056</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Aaaaand here's part 3 of the Notos Blues &amp; Jazz Band Experience's contribution to the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/mobile-task-force-contest">MTF Contest</a>! I'm super happy to be getting back into writing the Orthodoxy, though I do wish I could have included more of those lovely, crunchy technical footnotes.</p> <p>In case you missed it, I'd recommend reading <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2474">SCP-2474</a> and the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/m13-personnel-memorabilia-log">M13 Personnel Memorabilia Log</a> to get the full story, as it now stands.</p> <p>Massive thanks are due to my teammates <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kalinin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2203795&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1456425093" alt="Kalinin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2203795)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kalinin" >Kalinin</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=560062&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1456425093" alt="minmin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=560062)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" >minmin</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404533&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1456425093" alt="Zyn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" >Zyn</a></span>, of course, and also to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/embertech" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2259245&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1456425093" alt="EmberTech" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2259245)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/embertech" >EmberTech</a></span> for indirectly inspiring the name and helping me translate it.</p> <p>The Orthodoxy is going to space!</p> 
